  "name": "Mergeuz Sausages",
  "text": "Mergeuz Sausages\n\nPrep Time: 15 minutes\n\nTotal Time: 15 minutes\n\nIngredients\n\n250 g lamb,\n\n250 g beef,\n\n120 g ground or finely chopped fat,\n\n3 cloves garlic, finely chopped or pressed,\n\n2 tbsp chopped fresh coriander,\n\n2 tbsp merguez sausage seasoning,\n\n2 to 3 tsp harissa,\n\nSheep sausage casings\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Mince the meat through a 6mm plate.\n\n2. Mix the ingredients in a bowl. (Add ice water?)\n\n3. Mince the batch again through a 6mm plate or process briefly in a food processor.\n\n4. Fill out into pre soaked natural sheep casings 20/22 or 22/24.",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
