      "text": "2. Mix the ingredients in a bowl. (Add ice water?)"
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Mince the batch again through a 6mm plate or process briefly in a food processor."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Fill out into pre soaked natural sheep casings 20/22 or 22/24."
    }
